      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Welcome to the Rhythm Doctor Level Editor!</b>\nHere you can make your own custom levels, or play imported custom levels from other creators.\n\n\nWhen sharing level files or making video content, please be respectful to musicians and follow these guidelines:\n- Do not publicly share levels without permission of the song's musician\n- Do not publicly share videos/streams of levels without permission of the song's musician\n- Do not message musicians who have already given permission or declined permission for their songs\n- Do not ask any artists permission to use any music from any other rhythm games\n\n\nYou can find a list of musicians who have given permission and those that have declined permission <link = \"https://7thbe.at/verified-artists/rd\"><color=#7FE5FF><b>here</b></color></link>.\nYou can find a quick and easy template of how to ask a musician for permission to use their song <link =\"https://7thbe.at/adofai/artist-request-template\"><color=#7FE5FF><b>here</b></color></link>.\nYou can find more information and more custom levels on our community's Discord server: <link =\"https://discord.gg/rhythmdr/\"><color=#7FE5FF><b>discord.gg/rhythmdr</b></color></link>.\n\n\n<b>Legal notice:</b> Please note that you should comply with the Rhythm Doctor End-User License Agreement. You can find the EULA on our game's Steam store page. All third-party claims regarding ownership of images, audio, or other material present in the content created and shared by the user using the Level Editor will be the responsibility of the user. Infringing the copyright may face corresponding actions such as DMCA takedown or accusation. Use at your own risk.\n\n\nThank you for reading, and enjoy the level editor!\n"
