    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Click anywhere on the timeline to create an event.\nRight click on an event to delete it.\n\nClick a bar number to preview the level. (shift/ctrl for fast/slow)\nRight click a bar number to place a bookmark. (shift to change color)\n\nKeyboard shortcuts:\n> p: Play/Pause\n> f: Fullscreen preview\n> a: Autoplay\n> m: Metronome\n> j/k: Scroll left/right\n\n> ctrl+c: Copy, ctrl+x: Cut, ctrl+v: Paste \n> ctrl+b: Paste to next bar\n> ctrl+d / alt+drag: Duplicate\n> ctrl+z/y: Undo/Redo\n> ctrl+j/k: Undo/Redo position\n> ctrl+s: Save, ctrl+shift+s: Save as\n> ctrl+o: Open, ctrl+shift+o: Open recent\n\n> shift+click: Select multiple events\n> alt+drag: Rectangle select\n> ctrl+click: Disable event\n> ctrl+home/end: Select all to left/right (shift to include all tabs)\n> ctrl+shift+a: Select all in bar\n\n> alt+scroll: Nudge position\n> ctrl+scroll: Change beat tick\n> 1,2,3,4,5: Switch between tabs\n> ctrl+1,2,3,4: Switch between rows' rooms\n> ctrl+shift+r: Test level\n\n> ctrl+plus/minus: Change UI scale\n> ctrl+w: Change window resolution\n> alt+enter: Fullscreen window\n> alt+s: Open settings"
